What does this program print?

```php
<?php
$code = "2";
echo match ($code) {
    2 => "two (int)",
    "2" => "two (string)",
    default => "other",
}, "\n";
```

What does this program print?

```php
<?php
$qty = 0;
echo $qty ?: 1, $qty ?? 1, "\n";
```

What number does this program print?

```php
<?php
$n = 0;
for ($i = 1; $i <= 20; $i++) {
    if ($i % 3 === 0) {
        continue;
    }
    if ($i > 10) {
        break;
    }
    $n += $i;
}
echo $n, "\n";
```
